   Zhang, HJ (Corresponding Author), Chinese Acad Agr Sci, Agr Informat Inst, Beijing 100081, Peoples R China.
   Khan, Nawab; Zhang, Shemei, Sichuan Agr Univ, Coll Management, Chengdu 611130, Peoples R China.
